{"entry_id": "tcm-sz-001", "term": "淡红舌", "category": "舌色", "definition": "舌体颜色淡红润泽，为正常舌色，提示气血调和、脏腑功能正常。", "indications": "健康人舌象；亦见于外感病初起、病情轻浅者。", "scene_tags": ["诊疗", "养生"], "ontology_map": ["bo:tongue.color.pale_red", "bo:pattern.qi_blood_harmonized"], "source_ref": {"text": "《临证验舌法》", "chapter": "验舌法总纲", "quote": "舌色淡红，平人之常候也。"}, "annotation": {"confidence": "high", "scope": "通用", "human_reviewed": true}}
{"entry_id": "tcm-sz-002", "term": "淡白舌", "category": "舌色", "definition": "舌色较正常浅淡，甚者全舌色白无华，主气血两虚、阳虚寒证。", "indications": "气血不足、阳虚内寒；现代多见于贫血、慢性消耗性疾病。", "scene_tags": ["诊疗", "养生"], "ontology_map": ["bo:tongue.color.pale", "bo:pattern.qi_blood_deficiency", "bo:pattern.yang_deficiency_cold"], "source_ref": {"text": "《舌鉴辨正》", "chapter": "白舌总论", "quote": "淡白者，虚寒也，气血亏也。"}, "annotation": {"confidence": "high", "scope": "通用", "human_reviewed": true}}
{"entry_id": "tcm-sz-003", "term": "红舌", "category": "舌色", "definition": "舌色较正常红，主热证；舌红少苔多为阴虚内热，舌红苔黄多为实热。", "indications": "实热证、阴虚内热证。", "scene_tags": ["诊疗"], "ontology_map": ["bo:tongue.color.red", "bo:pattern.heat", "bo:pattern.yin_deficiency_heat"], "source_ref": {"text": "《舌鉴辨正》", "chapter": "红舌总论", "quote": "全舌红色，脏腑俱热也。"}, "annotation": {"confidence": "high", "scope": "通用", "human_reviewed": true}}
{"entry_id": "tcm-sz-004", "term": "绛舌", "category": "舌色", "definition": "舌色深红，较红舌更进一步，主热入营血，或阴虚火旺之重证。", "indications": "温病热入营血、久病阴虚火旺。", "scene_tags": ["诊疗"], "ontology_map": ["bo:tongue.color.crimson", "bo:pattern.heat_in_ying_blood"], "source_ref": {"text": "《温热论》", "chapter": "叶天士论舌", "quote": "其热传营，舌色必绛。绛，深红色也。"}, "annotation": {"confidence": "high", "scope": "温病/内伤发热", "human_reviewed": true}}
{"entry_id": "tcm-sz-005", "term": "青紫舌", "category": "舌色", "definition": "全舌或局部呈青紫色，或有瘀斑瘀点，主气血瘀滞；淡紫而润多属寒凝血瘀，紫红而干多属热盛血瘀。", "indications": "瘀血证、寒凝血瘀、热盛血瘀；亦见于某些心肺疾病。", "scene_tags": ["诊疗"], "ontology_map": ["bo:tongue.color.purple", "bo:pattern.blood_stasis"], "source_ref": {"text": "《舌鉴辨正》", "chapter": "青舌总论", "quote": "舌色青紫，乃瘀血之候。"}, "annotation": {"confidence": "medium", "scope": "通用", "human_reviewed": true}}
{"entry_id": "tcm-sz-006", "term": "薄白苔", "category": "苔色", "definition": "苔薄而白，均匀铺于舌面，为正常舌苔；病中见之多主表证初起、病邪轻浅。", "indications": "正常人；外感表证初起。", "scene_tags": ["诊疗", "养生"], "ontology_map": ["bo:coating.thin_white", "bo:pattern.exterior_initial"], "source_ref": {"text": "《临证验舌法》", "chapter": "验苔法", "quote": "薄白而润，平人之苔，亦表邪之初也。"}, "annotation": {"confidence": "high", "scope": "通用", "human_reviewed": true}}
{"entry_id": "tcm-sz-007", "term": "黄苔", "category": "苔色", "definition": "苔色发黄，主里证、热证；苔色越黄，热邪越深，黄而干燥为热盛伤津。", "indications": "里热证；黄腻苔主湿热或食积化热。", "scene_tags": ["诊疗"], "ontology_map": ["bo:coating.yellow", "bo:pattern.interior_heat"], "source_ref": {"text": "《舌鉴辨正》", "chapter": "黄苔总论", "quote": "黄苔者，里热也。"}, "annotation": {"confidence": "high", "scope": "通用", "human_reviewed": true}}
{"entry_id": "tcm-sz-008", "term": "腻苔", "category": "苔质", "definition": "苔质颗粒细腻致密，揩之不去，刮之不脱，主湿浊、痰饮内停。", "indications": "湿浊内蕴、痰饮、食积。", "scene_tags": ["诊疗", "养生"], "ontology_map": ["bo:coating.greasy", "bo:pattern.dampness_turbidity", "bo:pattern.phlegm_fluid"], "source_ref": {"text": "《临证验舌法》", "chapter": "验苔法", "quote": "腻者，湿浊痰饮之候也。"}, "annotation": {"confidence": "high", "scope": "通用", "human_reviewed": true}}
